          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Marathi for a contestant, then the Marathi for to carry off."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: फलंदाज",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "फलंदाज — phalandāj — \"a batsman; a batter\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "फलंदाजाने चेंडू मैदानाबाहेर मारला. phalandājāne ceṇḍū maidānābāher mārlā. The batsman hit the ball out of the ground."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "फलंदाज (phalandāj) is a Marathi coinage made on the pattern of गोलंदाज (golandāj), the bowler, whose -अंदाज is Persian andāz, \"thrower\". The first part is probably Sanskrit phala, glossed also as a blade (Monier-Williams): the flat face of the bat. That reading is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
